WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Give your Facebook page a smarter way to respond.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
A visitor asks a question.
n8n sends it to the AI agent.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.000
The agent references your business knowledge
to prepare a relevant answer.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.000
It sends the reply back
through the Facebook Graph API.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000
Less repetitive work.
More useful customer conversations.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Connect. Automate. Deliver.
